@main
// Runtime helper generator (Go `src/runtime` counterpart).
// Xu emits `_rt_*` into each binary; this file lives with cmd/compile
// because it uses Assembler (same package). User code does not import runtime.
// Multi-target: macOS/linux/windows, arm64/x64. Syscall numbers and
// Windows IAT calls branch on a.os / a.arch (set by the driver).
//
// Data labels: rt_itoa_buf (32)  rt_true  rt_false  rt_newline
//   rt_freelists (1024)  rt_chunk_cursor (8)  rt_chunk_end (8)
//   rt_argv_arr (24)  CHUNK_SIZE=65536  LARGE_CLASS=255

#xu/types

// Exit with code already in A0 (or load first). Cover mode dumps the
// coverage table first (covers exit()/assert/oom/div0 direct-exit paths).
